# Content-addressed artifact storage (storage.py, FR-1.2).
#
# These are students' resumes. The digest is the filename, so a committed blob
# is a real document in the repository history for ever — and "immutably
# stored" is a property of the object store, never a reason to version it.
# Override the location with M01_BLOB_ROOT.
blobs/
